    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the civil practice law and rules and the state finance law, in\nrelation to the disposal of property upon a judgment or order of forfeiture",
    "basePrintNo": "S8760",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8760-2017",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [
